==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Darkmadillo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 100~106.67 seconds<sup>3,000f~3,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
